{"cluster_id": "C-0130", "topic": "backlog finding", "target": "BACKLOG", "member_ids": ["AUDIT-M2-433"], "canonical_claim": "Open question from the mount-lease self-race fix proposal: whether the existing `ProfileEvents::CasMountLeaseLost` counter (already incremented by `superseded`/`foreign_writer`/`vanished`) should semantically absorb the new self-raced-renewal case or warrant its own more specific counter, mirroring the `CasGcRetiredSparedByReref` split tracked under BACKLOG item `RECOVERED-INDEGREE-ATTRIBUTION`.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-24-cas-mount-lease-self-race-fix-proposal.md#L219-L229"]}
